# Alex Marshall

> Alex Marshall is an executive coach and artist based in London, working with founders, executives, and product leaders.

Alex is a former Silicon Valley founder turned executive coach and artist. He grew up across four countries (Mexico, the US, Spain, and England) and speaks multiple languages. He previously co-founded Twingate and worked at Dropbox and Bloomberg.

